{"id":"024b320d234d188f","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-theory.md","title":"基础上加入句子公理和定理规则的经典真理理论","display":"df-truth-theory — 基础上加入句子公理和定理规则的经典真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-theory","aliases":["91-df-truth-theory"],"display":"df-truth-theory — 基础上加入句子公理和定理规则的经典真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-theory — 基础上加入句子公理和定理规则的经典真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为基础公理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 为附加公理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_T\">\\(\\mathcal R_T\\)</span> 为作用于无假设定理的附加规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}\\)</span> 是经典逻辑和所列定理规则的最小证明闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> 为下述理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>附加公理必须包括该版本要求的归纳：若 S 仅是基础 PA，标准 TB/UTB/CT/FS/KF 的 Ind_T 需列入 A_T。不能在模式定义中无声地遗漏它。\n没有一个通用 Ax_T 或否定双条件适用于所有系统。FS 的 NEC/CONEC 只对无假设定理使用；这不是在任意开放假设下把它们当普通引入/消去规则。\n本节点明确限定经典系统，部分逻辑 PKF 需要把背景演绎关系改为相应部分逻辑，不能沿用此 CL 闭包而声称已定义 PKF。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1 的 PA_T；Definitions 7.1–7.3、14.4、15.2；Chapter 16。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal T_T(S,\\mathcal A_T,\\mathcal R_T)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL},\\mathcal R_T}(S\\cup\\mathcal A_T).","display":true}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_T$ (真理理论, see [[91-df-truth-theory]])"},{"id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c5085dd84d7b744a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"656104419469b4d0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3d4231874a161ab6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c05617254d3afc97","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_T$ (真理理论, see [[91-df-truth-theory]])"},{"id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7443277cb04c8e58","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[